---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { PINNED_DATASET } from '../data/dataset-manifest';
---

<BaseLayout title="Home">
  <h1>Make yourself expensive to track.</h1>

  <p>
    Protect is a free tool that walks you through opting out of data brokers — by hand, without
    handing your data to a paid service to do it for you.
  </p>

  <h2>Why this is different</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>No server touches your information.</strong> This is a static page. Your name,
      address, and progress are stored only in this browser, never sent anywhere.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>You don't have to take our word for it.</strong> The code is open source — read it
      yourself, or have someone technical you trust read it.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>No account, no signup.</strong> Nothing to create, nothing to lose access to.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>The broker data is a public commons</strong>, not something this app owns —
      it credits and builds on prior public research, and this app is just one way to use it.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <p class="build-info">
    Dataset version <code>{PINNED_DATASET.datasetVersion}</code>, content hash
    <code>{PINNED_DATASET.contentHash.slice(0, 16)}…</code> — verified against this build on load.
  </p>

  <p>
    <a href="/profile">Get started →</a>
  </p>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .build-info {
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--graphite);
  }
</style>
